    <entry>
      <title>【杂谈】关于学习使用git提交本站代码心得</title>
      <link href="/posts/4b3a7441.html"/>
      <url>/posts/4b3a7441.html</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="一、问题背景"><a href="#一、问题背景" class="headerlink" title="一、问题背景"></a>一、问题背景</h2><blockquote><p>在本次博客的建设中，我使用 GitHub Pages 完成这个项目，并且直接在 GitHub 库中存储数据。</p></blockquote><h2 id="二、报错详情"><a href="#二、报错详情" class="headerlink" title="二、报错详情"></a>二、报错详情</h2><p>但是在推送时却失败了：</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">error: failed to push some refs to &#x27;https://github.com/RivYayoi/RivYayoi.github.io.git&#x27;</span><br><span class="line">hint: Updates were rejected because a pushed branch tip is behind its remote</span><br><span class="line">hint: counterpart. If you want to integrate the remote changes, use &#x27;git pull&#x27;</span><br><span class="line">hint: before pushing again.</span><br><span class="line">hint: See the &#x27;Note about fast-forwards&#x27; in &#x27;git push --help&#x27; for details.</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="三、初尝试：强制推送"><a href="#三、初尝试：强制推送" class="headerlink" title="三、初尝试：强制推送"></a>三、初尝试：强制推送</h2><p>进行拉取依然无效，我只能进行强制推送：</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">git push -f origin main</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="四、标准解决方案：Rebase-同步"><a href="#四、标准解决方案：Rebase-同步" class="headerlink" title="四、标准解决方案：Rebase 同步"></a>四、标准解决方案：Rebase 同步</h2><p>后来我了解到需要使用 rebase 同步远程改动：</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">git pull --rebase origin main</span><br><span class="line">git rebase --continue</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="五、日常推送流程"><a href="#五、日常推送流程" class="headerlink" title="五、日常推送流程"></a>五、日常推送流程</h2><p>在多次拉取和推送之后终于恢复正常，日常操作如下：</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">git push -u origin main</span><br><span class="line">git add .</span><br><span class="line">git commit -m &quot;safe&quot;</span><br><span class="line">git push origin main</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="六、总结"><a href="#六、总结" class="headerlink" title="六、总结"></a>六、总结</h2><p><strong>本次我对于 git 的理解从零到一，更上一层。</strong></p>]]></content>
      
      
      <categories>
          
          <category> 杂谈 </category>
          
      </categories>
      
      
        <tags>
            
            <tag> git </tag>
            
        </tags>
      
    </entry>
    
    
    
    <entry>
      <title>【Java菜鸟日记1】BMI指数计算</title>
      <link href="/posts/c0b8176.html"/>
      <url>/posts/c0b8176.html</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="一、前言"><a href="#一、前言" class="headerlink" title="一、前言"></a>一、前言</h2><p>零基础开始学习Java第一条博客。</p><h2 id="二、题目要求"><a href="#二、题目要求" class="headerlink" title="二、题目要求"></a>二、题目要求</h2><p>编写一个程序，读取用户输入的<strong>体重（千克）<strong>与</strong>身高（米）</strong>，计算 BMI 指数并给出体重分级建议。</p><h3 id="2-1-BMI-分级标准"><a href="#2-1-BMI-分级标准" class="headerlink" title="2.1 BMI 分级标准"></a>2.1 BMI 分级标准</h3><table><thead><tr><th>区间</th><th>状态</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>BMI &lt; 18.5</td><td>体重过轻</td></tr><tr><td>18.5 ≤ BMI &lt; 24</td><td>体重正常</td></tr><tr><td>24 ≤ BMI &lt; 27</td><td>体重偏胖</td></tr><tr><td>27 ≤ BMI &lt; 30</td><td>体重肥胖</td></tr><tr><td>BMI ≥ 30</td><td>体重严重肥胖</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="三、完整代码"><a href="#三、完整代码" class="headerlink" title="三、完整代码"></a>三、完整代码</h2><p>接下来展示代码：</p><figure class="highlight java"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">package</span> first1code;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">import</span> java.util.Scanner;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">public</span> <span class="keyword">class</span> <span class="title class_">BMI</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">static</span> <span class="type">void</span> <span class="title function_">main</span><span class="params">(String[] args)</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        System.out.println(<span class="string">&quot;请输入体重（单位：千克）&quot;</span>);</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="type">Scanner</span> <span class="variable">sc</span> <span class="operator">=</span> <span class="keyword">new</span> <span class="title class_">Scanner</span>(System.in);</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="type">double</span> <span class="variable">weight</span> <span class="operator">=</span> sc.nextDouble();</span><br><span class="line">        System.out.println(<span class="string">&quot;请输入身高（单位：米）&quot;</span>);</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="type">double</span> <span class="variable">height</span> <span class="operator">=</span> sc.nextDouble();</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="type">double</span> <span class="variable">bmi</span> <span class="operator">=</span> weight / (height * height);</span><br><span class="line">        System.out.println(<span class="string">&quot;您的BMI值为：&quot;</span> + bmi);</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span>(bmi &lt; <span class="number">18.5</span>) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">            System.out.println(<span class="string">&quot;您的体重过轻&quot;</span>);</span><br><span class="line">        &#125;<span class="keyword">else</span> <span class="keyword">if</span>(bmi &lt; <span class="number">24</span>) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">            System.out.println(<span class="string">&quot;您的体重正常&quot;</span>);</span><br><span class="line">        &#125;<span class="keyword">else</span> <span class="keyword">if</span>(bmi &lt; <span class="number">27</span>) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">            System.out.println(<span class="string">&quot;您的体重偏胖&quot;</span>);</span><br><span class="line">        &#125;<span class="keyword">else</span> <span class="keyword">if</span>(bmi &lt; <span class="number">30</span>) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">            System.out.println(<span class="string">&quot;您的体重肥胖&quot;</span>);</span><br><span class="line">        &#125;<span class="keyword">else</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">            System.out.println(<span class="string">&quot;您的体重严重肥胖&quot;</span>);</span><br><span class="line">        &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="3-1-关键点说明"><a href="#3-1-关键点说明" class="headerlink" title="3.1 关键点说明"></a>3.1 关键点说明</h3><ol><li>使用 <code>Scanner</code> 从控制台读取双精度浮点数；</li><li>BMI 公式：<code>体重(kg) ÷ 身高(m)²</code>；</li><li>使用多段 <code>else if</code> 进行分级判断。</li></ol><h2 id="四、结果展示"><a href="#四、结果展示" class="headerlink" title="四、结果展示"></a>四、结果展示</h2><p>输入体重 65kg 与身高 1.72m，得到 BMI ≈ 21.97，判断为「体重正常」。</p><h2 id="五、小结"><a href="#五、小结" class="headerlink" title="五、小结"></a>五、小结</h2><p>通过这个小练习掌握了：</p><ul><li>控制台输入输出；</li><li>基础运算与分支逻辑；</li><li>Java 类结构与 <code>main</code> 方法的基本写法。</li></ul>]]></content>
      
      
